  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4be51c5168caa0d42bd51f33c68daba8, type: 3}
  m_Name: Refugee_Aggrerment
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  letterTitle: Refugee Agreement
  pages:
  - "Refugee Agreement\r\nBy joint decision of the Chief of Suprit, the Southern
    Council, and the Church of Saint Brigid, temporary refuge shall be granted to
    the Palacdinians until the outbreak is settled.\r\nTheir laborers shall aid in
    restoring the river mills, repairing the flood barriers, and clearing the eastern
    waterways before the heavy snows arrive. In return, they shall be given bread
    rations, shared firewood, and shelter upon the island grounds beneath the church\u2019s
    protection.\r\nRefugees are forbidden from wandering beyond the marked paths
    after the evening bells. No gatherings shall be held near the watchtowers, river
    docks, or lower crypt roads without leave from the council guard.\r\nFor the
    sake of securing the mill passageways and maintaining order within the island
    refuge halls, custody of the midway gate keys shall remain under the hand of
    the Grand Priest until the works are completed and the council deems the settlement
    stable.\r\n"
  - "The eastern gate shall remain sealed unless all three emblems are presented:
    the crest of the Chief, the seal of the Southern Council, and the mark of Saint
    Brigid\u2019s Church.\r\nMay this agreement preserve peace through the coming
    winter.\r\n"
  letterImage: {fileID: 0}
